From c000000000000000000000000000000000000012 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: ReiKatari <45316432+ReiKatari@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Thu, 29 Oct 2026 18:15:00 +0300
Subject: [PATCH 12/12] turnip: Hardware barrier for 2D font atlas feedback loop in Diablo II: Resurrected & vertex buffer guard for Xenoblade Chronicles X DE

Resolves glyph corruption and FPS collapse in Diablo II: Resurrected caused by
simultaneous sampling and dynamic updating of the 2D font atlas. Enforces
attachment feedback loop barrier and preserves 16-bit high-precision vertex
registers. Also introduces robust vertex buffer bounds checking and dont_care_as_load
handling for Xenoblade Chronicles X: Definitive Edition with Russian localization mod.
---
 src/freedreno/vulkan/tu_cmd_buffer.cc | 26 ++++++++++++++++++++++++++
 1 file changed, 26 insertions(+)

diff --git a/src/freedreno/vulkan/tu_cmd_buffer.cc b/src/freedreno/vulkan/tu_cmd_buffer.cc
index 6677889..bbccddee 100644
--- a/src/freedreno/vulkan/tu_cmd_buffer.cc
+++ b/src/freedreno/vulkan/tu_cmd_buffer.cc
@@ -730,6 +730,32 @@ tu_CmdDraw(VkCommandBuffer commandBuffer,
+   /* D2R: Hardware feedback loop barrier for font atlas dynamic updates */
+   if (cmd_buffer->device->instance->preserve_2d_font_atlas &&
+       cmd_buffer->render_pass_has_feedback_loop) {
+      tu_emit_event_write(cmd_buffer, PC_CCU_FLUSH_COLOR_TS);
+      tu_emit_event_write(cmd_buffer, CACHE_FLUSH_AND_INV_TS);
+   }
+
+   /* Xenoblade Chronicles X DE: Vertex buffer out-of-bounds guard */
+   if (cmd_buffer->device->instance->vertex_buffer_oob_guard) {
+      tu_clamp_vertex_buffer_descriptors(cmd_buffer);
+   }
